a:6:{s:5:"title";s:46:"We Are The Hansons Fantasy Magic and Parenting";s:8:"duration";s:8:"00:13:52";s:11:"description";s:866:"We Are The Hansons is a one-of-a-kind podcast blending the magic of parenting and the wonder f fantasy. Dive into the enchanting world f a family with 13 children, where we explore real-life parenting adventures, discipline strategies, family values, and life lessons. Along the way, we'll weave in stories of imagination, creativity, and the role of fantasy in nurturing young minds. From navigating the challenges of raising kids to discussing topics like Santa, the tooth fairy, and the easterbunny, this podcast is a heartwarming and magical journey for parents, dreamers, and anyone seeking inspiration for family life. <br />
<br />
