a:6:{s:5:"title";s:34:"We are the Hansons Anailyn's Birth";s:8:"duration";s:8:"00:43:39";s:11:"description";s:1024:"This episode of We Are The Hansons will recount the emotional and unforgettable story of Anailyns birth. As part of We Are The Hansons, this episode dives into the challenges, surprises, and triumphs of her arrival. We will share the raw emotions of finding out about her unexpected early arrival., the whirlwind three moths before her due date, and the experience of nacigating the NICU journey. Listeners will hear about the strength, faith, and resilience it took to face the unexpected, as the lessons learned along the way. This episode highlights the power of family support, the bond of parenthood, and the beauty that can emerge even from chaos. It will serve as both a heartfelt reflection and an inspiring message to others who have faced or are facing similar challenges. <br />
<br />
Become a supporter of this podcast: https://www.spreaker.com/podcast/we-are-the-hanson-s--6044253/support (https://www.spreaker.com/podcast/we-are-the-hanson-s--6044253/support?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss) .";s:9:"thumbnail";i:87019;s:4:"type";s:7:"YouTube";s:3:"url";s:43:"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hvEVv9IMvwc";}

a:6:{s:5:"title";s:51:"We Are The Hansons A Day In The Life Of The Hansons";s:8:"duration";s:8:"00:19:44";s:11:"description";s:739:"In this episode. we take you behind the scenes of our busy, beautiful, and sometimes chaotic family life with 13 kids. From the moment the alarm clock rings to bedtime routines and everything in between, we'll share how we juggle morning madness, school drop off's, meal times, household chores, extracurricular activities, and quality family time. This episode is a heartfelt look at the joy, love, and intentionality that fuels the Hanson household, offering inspiration for families of all sizes.<br />
<br />
